<title>JAPAN: Toyo Denki -95/96 group results.</title>
<headline>Toyo Denki -95/96 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 44.12		vs	   41.17</p>
<p> Operating     loss 1.49		vs     loss 1.05</p>
<p> Current	 loss 1.84		vs   loss 144    million</p>
